      "outcome": "Players will be able to leave the truck at the route end, find the delivery point, and unload without being pulled back into the driver seat. The compact first-person view will make the current objective and usable action clear enough to complete the local delivery loop.\n\nExact contract. Repo slug swift-arrival, start from exact candidate a1d96fe4ce7280501f3d193fc3c3058a23e8a914, which descends from baseline 84ff1745b29267708599e94036ec6f7a2a7e0457. Independent native X11 evidence bundle file:///company/outputs/swift-arrival-independent-playtest-20260828T043000Z is the source observation. It recorded: after driving to z=40 and pressing E to leave the seat, the prescribed A/S/mouse movement did not reach unloading; the final E reseated the player, host delivery completion never occurred, and playtest.sh exited 1. It also observed that persistent multi-line debug/event text obscured the scene and the HUD lacked an exit-state/destination cue.\n\nChange the smallest gameplay and presentation mechanisms needed so, after a seat exit at route end while carrying the crate, the player can orient, reach an unloadable destination position, and unload without accidental reseating. Make the live objective, destination/interaction affordance, and seat-exit state legible in the rendered first-person view; debug/event text must not materially cover normal play. Preserve the bounded local route, original placeholder assets, host-authoritative player/vehicle/cargo/delivery state, view-relative movement, real physical boundaries, deliberate-drop recovery, and positive/negative multiplayer semantics. Do not broaden content, publish, deploy, or use external effects.\n\nCommit all source/test/evidence changes as one candidate descended from a1d96fe4ce7280501f3d193fc3c3058a23e8a914. Run the declared gates and the documented player-like rendered X11 lane from pickup through deliberate drop/re-pickup, driving, seat exit, post-exit movement, and successful unload; preserve timestamped input trace, host/client logs, and strongest screenshots for exit and delivery. Report observations separately from judgement, name any known limits, and do not represent scripted probes as proof of player feel. A later independent reviewer, not this Work, will decide founder-review readiness.",
