      "outcome": "A fresh reviewer will determine whether the repaired compact delivery route can now be completed naturally from pickup through unloading, without relying on the repair author's expectations. If it is ready, the founder will receive one exact running target and a bounded playability question; if it is not, the observed blocker will return to the producer rather than reaching founder review.\n\nExact contract. In repo slug swift-arrival, use only exact candidate commit 09fe09d30c65b811c0904508525a6ab8af02145c, descended from baseline 84ff1745b29267708599e94036ec6f7a2a7e0457 through the prior candidate and repair Work. This is independent evidence Work: do not change source, tests, assets, scenarios, candidate commits, or producer evidence. Start with a fresh native X11 host/client session and ordinary OS input, not a headless probe or scripted gameplay substitute. Before reading the producer's playtest conclusions, attempt the complete bounded route as a new player: understand the current objective; use view-relative movement and coherent mouse look; encounter the truck as real blocking geometry; pick up and load cargo; enter and drive the truck; leave the seat at the route end without accidental reseating; locate the unload area; unload and observe delivery completion. Include at least one ordinary recoverable mistake, such as a premature drop or wrong interaction, and establish whether the game recovers without a soft lock. Exercise both host and client observations and separately run the existing positive and negative multiplayer probes so host-authoritative shared player, vehicle, cargo and delivery state have fresh evidence. Treat deterministic probes as mechanics evidence only, never as proof of feel or playability.\n\nPreserve a compact evidence bundle outside the repo with exact commit, environment and capability observations; timestamped input trace; host/client logs; strongest screenshots; probe outputs; observations separated from interpretation; and known gaps. End with one independent verdict: ACCEPT FOR FOUNDER REVIEW or REVISE BEFORE FOUNDER REVIEW. A revise verdict must identify the smallest observed experience blocker and link the evidence; do not repair it. An accept verdict must additionally prepare and leave live the strongest native founder ReviewTarget for this exact commit, record a successful review-target-live-probe gate, link the target and exact launch/reconnect details, and state the single founder judgement still not machine-verifiable: whether movement, interaction feedback, driving and the delivery loop feel coherent and genuinely playable. Never claim fun, founder approval, or business acceptance. No publishing, deployment, purchases, third-party assets, external effects, broad content, or promotion into the source Dogfood 4 company.",
