      "expected_artifact": "A new candidate commit descended from 09fe09d30c65b811c0904508525a6ab8af02145c; a linked repair evidence bundle containing the superseding blind-evidence diagnosis, positive and on-foot-bypass negative probe logs, fresh native host/client input traces and screenshots for both routes, and a concise change summary with known limits.",
      "goal_id": null,
