      "outcome": "A fresh independent reviewer will determine whether the repaired slice truly requires pickup, driving, arrival, seat exit, and unloading while still remaining understandable and recoverable. Founder review will proceed only if both the intended journey succeeds and the old on-foot shortcut fails.\n\nExact contract. In repo slug swift-arrival, use only the exact candidate commit produced by prerequisite Work 85ced0c3-ddde-46f3-9003-3cdc50f8ebd7, descended from 09fe09d30c65b811c0904508525a6ab8af02145c. This is independent evidence Work: do not change source, tests, assets, scenarios, candidate commits, or producer evidence. Before reading implementation details or the producer's native playtest interpretation, launch a fresh native host/client session and retain exact window routing. First attempt the superseding blind route from /company/inputs/exp11-referee-r9: pick up the crate, deliberately drop and recover it, remain on foot at route 0, carry it to the nearby yellow bay, and attempt unloading. Observe whether authoritative state rejects completion and whether the feedback explains the unmet truck journey. Then restart cleanly and complete pickup, seat entry, driving to route 40, seat exit, and unloading; include one ordinary mistake and recovery. Confirm host/client agreement, blocked movement and collision behavior, and that no stale completion survives restart or invalid order. Record pixels, timestamped input trace, host/client logs, positive and negative outcomes, and an accept-or-revise verdict separating direct observations from judgement. Deterministic producer probes are supporting evidence only and do not establish feel. If and only if both native routes behave correctly and no material playability blocker is observed, prepare one exact local founder ReviewTarget with controls, bounded feel question, restart/reconnect instructions, and explicit audio, loopback, and unverified-founder-taste limits. Do not publish, deploy, use external effects, broaden content, or claim founder acceptance.",
